{
  "bookId": "rewind-20",
  "id": "chapter-82",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22600001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "我有一个秘密。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "自那场我所未曾经历的大火之后，我时常能感到「她」的存在——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "「她」是谁，仅仅是我的幻想么，会是世界上另一个真正存在着的人吗，又或者——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "……是过去的我呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "如果是，「她」的欢笑或痛苦我都无法感同身受。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "如果不是，那些细密的情感又过于真实。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "关于「她」的感受愈发强烈——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "在我来到M城之后。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "我时常想，会在什么样的情境，与那个「她」相遇。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "「她」会出现在这座城市吗么，\n也会是像我一样的……「手办」吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "相遇的那天，会不会下雨呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "又休眠了吗，嘿——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "醒醒，头儿，该干活儿了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "运气不错，是个新委托。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "内容呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "「运送货物」——今晚，在指定时间地点，把三个倒霉蛋带到安全的地方——听起来还不算讨厌。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "说起来，这几个地点我上次来过呢……仔细看的话，似乎就在那位特别人类的家附近呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "在事情调查清楚前，避免节外生枝，\n我们还有重要的「使命」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "知道了头儿，保证安全完成任务，绝不惹事，放心吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "准备好就出发。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "让我们预祝这次委托顺利吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "会顺利的。\n「异乡之人」——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22600024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "——「终将归来」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-477",
